    wp_ch0_title: "Executive Summary",
    wp_ch0_p1: "This project is built upon the dual historic opportunities of global blockchain industrial restructuring and energy revolution, constructing a new generation of computing power mining ecosystem driven by clean energy as the core, distributed computing power as the value carrier, and blockchain technology as the trust foundation.",
